AMBARI-22517. NPE during Ambari schema upgrade while updating
 Hive configs.

Here is the root cause:
The bug was caused by a Null Pointer Exception (NPE) occurring when the code tried to access properties of `hsiSiteConfig` without checking if `hsiSiteConfig` was null. This situation could happen during the Ambari schema upgrade when the desired configuration for Hive Interactive Site is absent or improperly initialized.

